message: "If you reference the MSAM framework, please cite it as below."
title: "MSAM: Modern SIEM Architecture Models"
abstract: >-
  A framework that classifies SIEM architectures by where the primary control
  point sits (Converged, Observability-Connected, Pipeline-First, Data Platform,
  and Federated), with a decision guide and proof-of-concept checklist for
  security teams. First published by Software Analyst Cyber Research (SACR).
